    "cat_issues": "Order issues",
    "orders_1_question": "Can I order without creating an account?",
    "orders_1_answer": "Yes. Creating a customer account is not required to place an order on POUR.",
    "orders_2_question": "Can I create an account after placing an order?",
    "orders_2_answer": "Yes. You can create a customer account to access your orders and manage your personal information.",
    "orders_3_question": "Can I cancel my order?",
    "orders_3_answer": "Yes, as long as your order has not yet been processed. Once processing has started, it can no longer be cancelled.",
    "orders_4_question": "Can I change my order after placing it?",
    "orders_4_answer": "No. An order cannot be changed after it has been confirmed. If it has not yet been processed, you can request a cancellation and place a new order.",
    "orders_5_question": "How do I know if my order was successfully placed?",
    "orders_5_answer": "A confirmation email is automatically sent after your order has been confirmed.",
    "orders_6_question": "Will I receive an email when my order ships?",
    "orders_6_answer": "Yes. You will receive a shipping email containing your parcel tracking information.",
    "orders_7_question": "Where can I find my orders?",
    "orders_7_answer": "If you have a customer account, your orders are available in your personal account area.",
    "delivery_1_question": "Which countries do you ship to?",
    "delivery_1_answer": "We ship to France, Europe, the French overseas territories, Canada, Switzerland and the United States.",
    "delivery_2_question": "Which carriers do you use?",
    "delivery_2_answer": "We work with Colissimo and Chronopost. Available options depend on the destination and are shown at checkout.",
    "delivery_3_question": "How long does it take to prepare my order?",
    "delivery_3_answer": "Orders are generally prepared within 1 to 2 days before being shipped.",
    "delivery_4_question": "What are the delivery times?",
    "delivery_4_answer": "Delivery times vary by destination country and selected shipping service. The estimated delivery time is shown at checkout before you confirm your order.",
    "delivery_5_question": "Is shipping free?",
    "delivery_5_answer": "In France, shipping is free for orders over €150 with standard Colissimo or pickup point delivery.",
    "delivery_6_question": "How much does shipping cost?",
    "delivery_6_answer": "Shipping fees are calculated based on parcel weight, destination country and selected delivery method. The amount is shown at checkout.",
    "delivery_7_question": "How can I track my parcel?",
    "delivery_7_answer": "A tracking link is emailed to you when your order ships.",
    "delivery_8_question": "My parcel is marked as delivered but I have not received it. What should I do?",
    "delivery_8_answer": "Contact us through our contact form with your order number. We will help you with the necessary steps with the delivery service.",
    "returns_1_question": "How long do I have to make a return?",
    "returns_1_answer": "You have 14 days from receiving your order to request a return.",
    "returns_2_question": "What are the return conditions?",
    "returns_2_answer": "The item must be unworn, unwashed and still have its tag. The original packaging is not required.",
    "returns_3_question": "Can I return a sale or promotional item?",
    "returns_3_answer": "Yes. Sale or promotional items can also be returned within 14 days and subject to the applicable return conditions.",
    "returns_4_question": "Can I return an item simply because I changed my mind?",
    "returns_4_answer": "Yes. A return is possible within 14 days, provided the item meets the return conditions.",
    "returns_5_question": "Do you offer exchanges?",
    "returns_5_answer": "We do not offer standard exchanges. If you want another size or item, you can return the original and place a new order.",
    "returns_6_question": "Who pays return shipping?",
    "returns_6_answer": "Return shipping costs are paid by the customer, except when the return is caused by an error on our part.",
    "returns_7_question": "How do I request a return?",
    "returns_7_answer": "Return requests are made through our contact form. Include your order number and the information needed to process your request.",
    "returns_8_question": "How can I track my return?",
    "returns_8_answer": "When you ship your return, keep the parcel tracking information. It may be needed to track its journey.",
    "returns_9_question": "When will I be refunded?",
    "returns_9_answer": "The refund is processed as soon as possible after receipt and inspection of the return, within a maximum of 10 days. The time for the refund to appear in your account may then depend on your bank.",
    "returns_10_question": "How will I be refunded?",
    "returns_10_answer": "The refund is made to the payment method used for the order.",
    "products_1_question": "What sizes are available?",
    "products_1_answer": "For our first collection, sizes range from XXS to L. The size range may evolve across collections, including up to XL.",
    "products_2_question": "How do I choose my size?",
    "products_2_answer": "Check the size guide available on each product page. It helps you choose the size best suited to the fit of the piece.",
    "products_3_question": "Do all pieces have the same fit?",
    "products_3_answer": "No. Fits may vary from one piece to another. Model-specific information is provided on each product page.",
    "products_4_question": "Are the products made from organic cotton?",
    "products_4_answer": "Yes. Organic cotton is one of the preferred materials used by POUR for its pieces.",
    "products_5_question": "Do the colours shown on the site match the actual products?",
    "products_5_answer": "We photograph the pieces in their real colours to reproduce their appearance on the site as accurately as possible.",
    "products_6_question": "Where can I find detailed product information?",
    "products_6_answer": "Each product page presents the key information about the piece, its fit, features and care.",
    "care_1_question": "At what temperature should I wash my POUR garment?",
    "care_1_answer": "We recommend washing at 30°C.",
    "care_2_question": "Should I wash my garment inside out?",
    "care_2_answer": "Yes. Wash your garment inside out, preferably on a delicate cycle.",
    "care_3_question": "Can I put my garment in the dryer?",
    "care_3_answer": "No. We recommend avoiding the tumble dryer to best preserve the garment and its print.",
    "care_4_question": "How should I iron my garment?",
    "care_4_answer": "Iron the garment inside out and never iron directly over the print.",
    "care_5_question": "How do I preserve the print over time?",
    "care_5_answer": "Prefer a 30°C wash, inside out and on a delicate cycle. Avoid the tumble dryer and any direct contact between the iron and the print.",
    "payment_1_question": "Which payment methods do you accept?",
    "payment_1_answer": "We accept bank cards, Visa, Mastercard, American Express, Apple Pay and PayPal.",
    "payment_2_question": "When is my payment charged?",
    "payment_2_answer": "Payment is charged directly when the order is confirmed.",
    "payment_3_question": "Is payment secure?",
    "payment_3_answer": "Yes. Payment is handled through the store's secure payment system and payment information is processed securely.",
    "payment_4_question": "Can I pay with Apple Pay?",
    "payment_4_answer": "Yes, Apple Pay is available when the option is offered on your device and in your checkout flow.",
    "payment_5_question": "Can I pay with PayPal?",
    "payment_5_answer": "Yes, PayPal is accepted in the store.",
    "payment_6_question": "Why might my payment be declined?",
    "payment_6_answer": "A payment may be declined for various reasons related to the payment method used. Check your payment details or contact your bank. If the issue persists, contact us.",
    "account_1_question": "What is my customer account for?",
    "account_1_answer": "Your account lets you view your orders, track their status, manage your personal information and addresses, and access Club POUR features.",
    "account_2_question": "Can I order without an account?",
    "account_2_answer": "Yes. A customer account is not required to place an order.",
    "account_3_question": "Can I find an order placed without an account?",
    "account_3_answer": "Order information is also available in the emails sent after your purchase. Creating an account later lets you centralise your orders in your personal area.",
    "account_4_question": "Can I edit my personal information from my account?",
    "account_4_answer": "Yes. Your customer area lets you manage your information and saved addresses.",
    "club_1_question": "What is Club POUR?",
    "club_1_answer": "Club POUR is the space dedicated to benefits and community loyalty. Available features can be accessed from your customer account.",
    "club_2_question": "How do I access Club POUR?",
    "club_2_answer": "Club POUR is accessible from your customer account when you are signed in.",
